# Written for this pack by BurN-30 (GPL-3.0). Same sources as the Scarlet Monastery steps of
# 21-terres-ingrates-hinterlands.guide (Polestar's Forever data and Dungeons codex; bosses' levels:
# Loksey 34, Doan 37, Herod 40, Mograine and Whitemane 42; Past Due, 96800, from Wowhead Forever,
# 08/11/2026; Mythology of the Titans from Warcraft Tavern, 11/11/2026). Not played in game yet.
#
# Self-contained chapter for Polestar's own route (prototype, branch greffe): the Groupe Alliance
# module offers it once Down the Scarlet Path (1052) is turned in to Raleigh the Devout in
# Southshore, where Polestar's route says "Raleigh's next errand is in the Scarlet Monastery: skip
# it" (forever/alliance/40-50/02-badlands, about level 44), and opens it in a tab of its own:
# Polestar's guide keeps its place in its tab and comes back when this chapter ends or its tab is
# closed (GroupeAlliance/Greffe.lua, GreffeData.lua). No `when group` question and no `next`.
#
# Mythology of the Titans (1050) is Librarian Mae Paledust's quest in Ironforge, which Polestar's
# route does not take: the Library's tip says where its book lies, with no goal of its own.
guide groupe-alliance/greffe/monastere-ecarlate
title Dungeon · The Scarlet Monastery (34-46)
folder Group Alliance
category Dungeons
faction Alliance
levels 36-46
zone Hillsbrad Foothills

step Southshore: Raleigh the Devout
  tip The Scarlet Monastery: four wings in Tirisfal Glades, for a group of 5, levels 30 to 42 (group finder: Graveyard 30-38, Library 33-41, Armory 36-44, Cathedral 38-46). The Library, the Armory and the Cathedral hold the quests.
  accept 1053                                 -- Raleigh the Devout, upstairs in the inn: four Scarlet bosses

step Magus Olvek
  zone Alterac Mountains
  tip On the way north: he stands on the western edge of the Dalaran crater, by the road from Hillsbrad to Silverpine.
  accept 96800                                -- Magus Olvek: Past Due, Arcanist Doan's book

step Before entering the Scarlet Monastery
  zone Tirisfal Glades
  tip Ride through Silverpine Forest, then east across Tirisfal Glades: Horde land, keep clear of Brill and the guards on the roads. The monastery stands in the far north-east; the four wings are four doors in the courtyard.
  note In the log before going in: In the Name of the Light (Raleigh, Southshore) and Past Due (Magus Olvek, Alterac); Mythology of the Titans too for whoever took it from Mae Paledust in Ironforge. Share each quest with the group: click it in the quest log, then Share.
  goto 82.6,33.8 "Scarlet Monastery" r 25

step The Library: Houndmaster Loksey and Arcanist Doan
  tip Loksey and his dogs wait in a small alcove near the start. Doan is the last boss: at half health he shields himself and blows up everything near him, run out and come back. The red book for Magus Olvek is on a table on the right of Doan's room; Mythology of the Titans, for whoever took it in Ironforge, on the floor of a Library corridor, under a window; the Scarlet Key, for the Armory and Cathedral doors, in the chest behind him.
  kill 3974 quest 1053                        -- Houndmaster Loksey, elite 34
  kill 6487                                   -- Arcanist Doan, elite 37
  collect 273169 quest 96800                  -- The Lost Magic of the Runemasters, red book on a table in Doan's room

step The Armory: Herod
  tip Herod spins with Whirlwind: everyone but the tank steps away until it ends. When he dies, a wave of trainees runs in: fight them at the door.
  kill 3975 quest 1053                        -- Herod, elite 40

step The Cathedral: Mograine and Whitemane
  tip Clear the chapel's pews first: pulling Mograine brings the whole room. Mograine first; when he falls, Whitemane runs in, puts the group to sleep and raises him once: kill him again, then her.
  kill 3976 quest 1053                        -- Scarlet Commander Mograine, elite 42
  kill 3977 quest 1053                        -- High Inquisitor Whitemane, elite 42

step Back to Magus Olvek
  zone Alterac Mountains
  turnin 96800                                -- Magus Olvek

step Southshore rewards
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip Last stop of the chapter: the route's own guide comes back once this is handed in.
  turnin 1053                                 -- Raleigh the Devout, upstairs in the inn
